[[File:{{PAGENAME}}-skeleton.png|150px]] {{PAGENAME}} Skeleton. Can be collected for [[Bone Material]].<br>

=Notes=

*Spawn in groups ranging sizes 1-5 in shallow water.
*Very easy to fight, weaker than a fox.
*Run with 3rd speed on water, and 2nd on land.

